<title>USA: Steady FX key to Japan's T-bill holdings-Hashimoto.</title>
<headline>Steady FX key to Japan's T-bill holdings-Hashimoto.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto said stable exchange rates are critical to Japan maintaining its holdings of U.S. government securities.</p>
<p>&quot;I hope the U.S. will engage in efforts and in cooperation to maintan exchange stability so we will not succumb to the temptation to sell off Treasury bills and switch our funds to gold,&quot; Hashimoto said in a question-and-answer session following a speech carried live on Reuters Financial Television (RFTV).</p>
</text>
